     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Forwarded message ----------<br>From: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">Google Summer of Code</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">summerofco...@google.com</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Wed, Apr 19, 2017 at 5:40 PM<br>Subject: GSoC 2017: Project Slots for R project for statistical computing<br>To: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bgpbra...@gmail.com</a>, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tdh...@gmail.com</a>, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">becario...@gmail.com</a><br><br><br><u></u>\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\r\n<div bgcolor=\"#f6f6f6\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;min-height:100%;width:100%\">\r\n\t\r\n\t<table bgcolor=\"#f6f6f6\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:20px 20px 10px 20px;width:100%\">\r\n\t\t<tbody><tr style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:20px 20px 20px 20px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0;clear:both;display:block;Margin:0 auto;max-width:600px\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<table width=\"100%\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;border-bottom:2px solid #f0f0f0;margin-bottom:20px\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tbody><tr style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"280\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Google Summer of Code\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/v7BjypS1rczHOKzxzRU-LdtkFv_J3drGf6tjwBFMSSlGwQrHSM3ZjgRroIV3r1ANM14pOCG-F41rBmNUA1K79eaf21t8ZsNGmlk_nuoZrpDYTTPOgA5DAx8ZNQ=s0-d-e1-ft#https://storage.googleapis.com/gsoc-static/summer-of-code-logo-email.png\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:600px;font-size:32px;width:auto;margin-bottom:10px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;color:#666666\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t</tbody></table>\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;padding:0;margin:0 auto;display:block;max-width:600px\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;width:100%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody><tr style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\">\r\n<p>Hello R project for statistical computing Org Admins,</p>\r\n<p>Congratulations, R project for statistical computing has been granted 37 project slots for GSoC 2017.</p>\r\n<p>It is now time to choose the student proposals you want to have as projects for your organization. You must assign at least one mentor when you select a student.</p>\r\n<p>Your organization is not required to use all of the slots allocated. Please note that you <strong>cannot</strong> give your unused slots to other organizations.</p>\r\n<p>We have a fixed number of student project slots and have distributed them across all of the accepted organizations. If you were hoping for more student slots this year -- we are sorry -- no additional slots will be allocated.</p>\r\n<p>You may wish to re-review the <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/open-source/gsoc/help/slot-allocation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://developers.google.com/open-source/gsoc/help/slot-allocation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351421634000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0L8jCTOgpg3RaUXqmLduer\">slot allocation guidelines</a> for information on student selection criteria and handling conflicts.</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions about this process, please ask about it on the Mentors&#39; list or email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gsoc-s...@google.com</a>.</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</tbody></table>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\"></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody></table>\r\n\t\r\n\r\n<table bgcolor=\"#f6f6f6\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0 40px;width:100%;clear:both\">\r\n  <tbody><tr style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\">\r\n\t<td style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\"></td>\r\n\t<td style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;clear:both;display:block;Margin:0 auto;max-width:600px\">\r\n\t  \r\n\t  <div style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;padding:0;margin:0 auto;display:block;max-width:540px\">\r\n\t\t<table style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;width:100%\">\r\n\t\t  <tbody><tr style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\">\r\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\">\r\n\t\t\t  <p style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:11px;color:#666666\">\r\n\t\t\t  You are receiving this email because of your participation in Google Summer of Code 2017. <br style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0\"><a href=\"https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;color:#348eda;font-size:11px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351421634000&amp;usg=AOvVaw25Lm6PeK0i8n1oviuU0GsF\">https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com</a>\r\n\t\t\t  </p>\r\n\t\t\t  <p style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Helvetica&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6em;margin:0;padding:0;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:11px;color:#666666\">\r\n\t\t\t  To leave t